OL,3,APhotos show widespread damage at US
OL,4,Asites from Iranian attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FImages showing widespread damage to
OL,7,Fmultiple US sites in the Middle East
OL,8,Ffrom Iranian strikes have been obtained
OL,9,Fby the BBC's US partner CBS.
OL,11,FThe photos, provided by active military
OL,12,Fpersonnel, show a severed radar jet,
OL,13,Fflattened trailers and severely damaged
OL,14,Fbuildings.
OL,16,FThe undated photos were taken at US
OL,17,Fbases and sites in Saudi Arabia and
OL,18,FKuwait.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
